              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Handlers and Status Codes",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`req.params.id` path, `req.query.q` URL, `req.body.x` needs a parser",
                "Reply with `res.status(n).json(obj)`",
                "Every middleware calls ==next()== or **responds**",
                "Params are strings; query values are strings or arrays"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
