            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Final Checklist",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Parser before routes",
                "Specific routes before dynamic ones",
                "`return` after responding",
                "Error handler ==last==",
                "Async errors forwarded to `next(err)`"
              ],
              "style": "checkbox"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Interview point",
              "text": "**Why four arguments?** Express spots error handlers by arity. **Why return after res.json?** A second send throws."
            }
